Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.30,0:13:57.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}初号機で砲手を担当
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.95,0:14:00.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}はい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.95,0:14:03.63,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}レイは零号機で防御を担当して
